class.description:
[CgameBitReader] consumes a [PackedByteArray] with bit granularity. Every [code]read_*[/code] method mirrors the [code]write_*[/code] method of [CgameBitWriter] with the same parameters.
Reading past the end of the data never errors: missing bits read as zero and [method is_overflowed] becomes [code]true[/code]. Check it after decoding untrusted packets.
[codeblock]
var r := CgameBitReader.create(packet)
var a := r.read_bits(3)
var x := r.read_float(-100.0, 100.0, 16)
var q := r.read_quaternion()
if r.is_overflowed():
    push_warning("truncated packet")
[/codeblock]
